{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45542","headline":"题广爱寺楞伽山 · 净显","name":"题广爱寺楞伽山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵异不能栖鸟雀，幽奇终不着猿猱。\n爲经巢贼应无损，纵使秦驱也谩劳。\n珍重昔贤留像迹，陵迁谷变自坚牢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"净显","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}